# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build-context filter for the v3.2 incremental image builds.
#
# The v3.2 Dockerfiles only copy application code (scheduler/, hospital/,
# clinic/, common/, frontend/dist, test/test_dataset.json, benchmark/), so the
# heavy research artifacts are excluded to keep `docker build` fast.
#
# NOTE: the from-scratch Dockerfile.full variants need the DoubleTower model
# weights, which are no longer in the repo - restore them from the cluster
# (/data/medical-model/weights), Harbor or a local archive before a full rebuild.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# VCS / tooling / test scratch
.git
.gitignore
.lx-test
.docker-cfg
.npm-cache
.claude
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*.log
**/*.log

# Node deps: builds use the pre-built frontend/dist, never node_modules
node_modules
**/node_modules
frontend/*.tsbuildinfo

# Research / reference material not needed by any image
*.docx
*.doc
*.pdf
*.zip
